{"track":"python","category":"기초 문법","level":1,"title":"거듭제곱","desc":"<p><code>base</code>를 <code>exp</code>번 거듭제곱한 값을 돌려주는 <code>power(base, exp)</code>를 만드세요. 파이썬의 거듭제곱 연산자는 <code>**</code> 예요.</p>","starter":"def power(base, exp):\n    pass\n","solution":"def power(base, exp):\n    return base ** exp\n","hint":"<p><code>2 ** 3</code> 은 8이에요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"power(2, 10)","expected":1024,"visible":true},{"call":"power(5, 0)","expected":1,"visible":true},{"call":"power(3, 3)","expected":27,"visible":false},{"call":"power(10, 2)","expected":100,"visible":false},{"call":"power(-2, 3)","expected":-8,"visible":false}],"id":"py-024"}